  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n? = (243)² ÷ (27)² × 6 ÷ 18\n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/63b5796508f25e98924507058c8500646765edb9e8aa9bc7c6da0879b4620923.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ ? = (243)² ÷ (27)² × 6 ÷ 18\n\n⇒ ? = 81 × 6 ÷ 18\n\n⇒ ? = 27\n\n**∴ (243)² ÷ (27)² × 6 ÷ 18 = 27**",
